        "contentBasis": "page_text",
        "excerpt": "The RFC Editor is made up of several different groups who work together to edit, publish, and archive RFCs . The current RFC Editor operating structure is defined in RFC 9920 and comprises the following groups.",
        "sourceGroup": "rfc-editor.org",
